---
description: |
  Reduces the volume of HarfangLab ECS documents for a SIEM. The operator
  summarizes network connections and URL requests, and deduplicates process
  starts and library loads, with `harfanglab::ecs::summarize_network`,
  `harfanglab::ecs::summarize_http`,
  `harfanglab::ecs::deduplicate_processes`, and
  `harfanglab::ecs::deduplicate_modules`. Set `network`, `http`,
  `processes`, or `modules` to `false` to pass those documents through
  unchanged. All other documents, such as alerts, audit logs, DNS
  resolutions, and authentications, pass through unchanged.

  Only summaries carry `tenzir.count`, the number of events they stand for, so
  a SIEM that counts events must sum `tenzir.count` and count every other
  event as one. Windows follow processing time and align to the epoch:
  summaries leave in one burst at each window boundary, up to one window after
  their events, so search them by index time. Each summary covers at most one
  window of event time per host, so late events get their own summaries and
  none is dropped. Open windows live in memory and are lost on a restart;
  first occurrences have already left by then.

  Memory grows with the summaries per window: about 2 KB per network or HTTP
  summary, 3 KB per module and 5 KB per process summary, plus 0.4 KB per
  distinct process or module key. After an outage of N windows, the drained
  backlog needs about N times as much. Summaries keep at most 10 URL paths, a
  query string only if it is the same for all requests, no module base
  addresses, and no process IDs of several repeats, so detections on these
  fields need the full events, for example in a data lake.
args:
  named:
    - name: network_window
      type: duration
      default: 5min
      description: Width of the network connection summary windows.
    - name: http_window
      type: duration
      default: 5min
      description: Width of the URL request summary windows.
    - name: process_window
      type: duration
      default: 1h
      description: Width of the process start deduplication windows.
    - name: module_window
      type: duration
      default: 1h
      description: Width of the library load deduplication windows.
    - name: network
      type: bool
      default: true
      description: Summarize network connections.
    - name: http
      type: bool
      default: true
      description: Summarize URL requests.
    - name: processes
      type: bool
      default: true
      description: Deduplicate process starts.
    - name: modules
      type: bool
      default: true
      description: Deduplicate library loads.
---

if $network and event.category?.first() == "network" {
  harfanglab::ecs::summarize_network window=$network_window
} else if $http and event.category?.first() == "url" {
  harfanglab::ecs::summarize_http window=$http_window
} else if $processes and event.category?.first() == "process" {
  harfanglab::ecs::deduplicate_processes window=$process_window
} else if $modules and event.category?.first() == "library" {
  harfanglab::ecs::deduplicate_modules window=$module_window
}
